# Never commit anything naming a live node. Node addresses belong only in
# wan/nodes.txt. These are patterns, not exact paths: the first version of
# this file listed wan/nodes.txt alone, and a later run leaked the same
# addresses under results/ as wg-pubkeys.txt. Result logs themselves are
# kept, since they are the evidence for the published numbers.
wan/nodes.txt
wg-pubkeys.txt
**/wg-pubkeys.txt
.DS_Store
